OL,3,GNEWSAHigh school evacuated over
OL,4,Amalicious communications
OL,5,
OL,6,FA secondary school has been evacuated
OL,7,Fafter reports of malicious
OL,8,Fcommunications were sent, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FSuffolk Police was called to Stoke High
OL,12,FSchool Ormiston Academy in Ipswich just
OL,13,Fafter 08:05 BST.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the force said
OL,16,Fofficers were at the school site on
OL,17,FMaidenhall Approach and were trying to
OL,18,Festablish the full circumstances of the
OL,19,Fincident.
